":"`Remove` 버튼은:"},"208":{"id":"/ja/usage/installed-20","page_id":"/ja/usage/installed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/installed#제거-동작","content":"확인 다이얼로그 표시"},"209":{"id":"/ja/usage/installed-21","page_id":"/ja/usage/installed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/installed#제거-동작","content":"`manifest.json`의 `dependencies`에서 해당 항목 삭제"},"210":{"id":"/ja/usage/installed-22","page_id":"/ja/usage/installed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/installed#제거-동작","content":"`Client.Resolve()`로 즉시 재해석"},"211":{"id":"/ja/usage/installed-23","page_id":"/ja/usage/installed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/installed#제거-동작","content":"> **빌트인 모듈(`com.unity.modules.*`)과 이 패키지 자신은 안전상 제거할 수 없습니다.**"},"212":{"id":"/ja/usage/installed-24","page_id":"/ja/usage/installed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/installed#미해결unresolved-항목","content":"`manifest.json`에는 있지만 Unity가 해석하지 못한 항목(잘못된 이름, 끊긴 Git 저장소, 네트워크 실패 등)은 상단에 **노란색 경고 배너**와 함께 따로 표시됩니다."},"213":{"id":"/ja/usage/installed-25","page_id":"/ja/usage/installed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/installed#미해결unresolved-항목","content":"각 미해결 항목에도 `Remove` 버튼이 붙으므로, **도구를 통해 깨진 매니페스트를 복구**할 수 있습니다."},"214":{"id":"/ja/usage/installed-26","page_id":"/ja/usage/installed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/installed#미해결unresolved-항목","content":"> 단, 매니페스트가 너무 망가져 패키지 매니저 자체가 로드되지 않는 경우엔 `Packages/manifest.json`을 직접 편집해서 깨진 항목을 지워주세요. 자세한 내용은 문제 해결 참조."},"215":{"id":"/ja/usage/openupm","page_id":"/ja/usage/openupm","type":"page","content":"OpenUPM 탭","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使い方"],"tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/openupm"},"216":{"id":"/ja/usage/openupm-0","page_id":"/ja/usage/openupm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/openupm#데이터-출처","content":"데이터 출처"},"217":{"id":"/ja/usage/openupm-1","page_id":"/ja/usage/openupm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/openupm#검색","content":"검색"},"218":{"id":"/ja/usage/openupm-2","page_id":"/ja/usage/openupm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/u