":"/ja/usage/openupm#설치-동작","content":"`package.openupm.com` 스코프 레지스트리가 없으면 추가, 있으면 병합"},"231":{"id":"/ja/usage/openupm-15","page_id":"/ja/usage/openupm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/openupm#설치-동작","content":"패키지 스코프를 자동 등록\\\n예: `com.cysharp.unitask` → 스코프 `com.cysharp`"},"232":{"id":"/ja/usage/openupm-16","page_id":"/ja/usage/openupm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/openupm#설치-동작","content":"`dependencies`에 패키지 이름 + 최신 버전(`dist-tags.latest`) 기록"},"233":{"id":"/ja/usage/openupm-17","page_id":"/ja/usage/openupm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/openupm#설치-동작","content":"`Client.Resolve()` 호출"},"234":{"id":"/ja/usage/openupm-18","page_id":"/ja/usage/openupm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/openupm#설치-동작","content":"결과 메시지가 우측 하단 노티피케이션으로 표시됩니다."},"235":{"id":"/ja/usage/openupm-19","page_id":"/ja/usage/openupm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/openupm#잘못된-이름-필터","content":"OpenUPM `/-/all`이 npm 포맷이라 `@scope/name` 같은 **UPM 규칙에 맞지 않는 이름**이 섞여 있을 수 있어요. 도구는 이를 자동으로 필터링해서 목록에서 제외합니다. (이 검증이 없다면 잘못 설치 시 매니페스트가 깨져 모든 resolve가 막힙니다.)"},"236":{"id":"/ja/usage/openupm-20","page_id":"/ja/usage/openupm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/openupm#이미-설치된-패키지","content":"설치된 패키지에는 `Installed` 배지가 표시되고, 버튼 라벨이 `Reinstall`로 바뀝니다."},"237":{"id":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting","page_id":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting","type":"page","content":"문제 해결","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使い方"],"tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting"},"238":{"id":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting-0","page_id":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting#project-has-invalid-dependencies-name-is-invalid","content":"`Project has invalid dependencies: <name> is invalid.`"},"239":{"id":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting-1","page_id":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting#error-cs0246-toolbarsearchfield-could-not-be-found","content":"`error CS0246: 'ToolbarSearchField' could not be found`"},"240":{"id"