eshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting#project-has-invalid-dependencies-name-is-invalid","content":"설치 시점부터 잘못된 이름은 도구가 막아주므로 재발하지 않습니다."},"249":{"id":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting-11","page_id":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting#error-cs0246-toolbarsearchfield-could-not-be-found","content":"`UnityEditor.UIElements` using이 빠졌을 때 발생합니다. 현재 코드엔 이미 들어가 있으므로, 구버전을 캐싱한 상태라면 패키지를 업데이트하세요."},"250":{"id":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting-12","page_id":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting#툴바가-위쪽에-찌부러져-보임","content":"`flexShrink` 기본값(1) 때문에 컨텐츠가 길어지면 툴바·상태바가 같이 눌렸던 버그예요. 1.0.0+에서 `flexShrink = 0`으로 고정해서 해결했습니다. 구버전을 쓰고 있다면 업데이트하세요."},"251":{"id":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting-13","page_id":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting#패키지가-최신으로-안-바뀜","content":"Git 의존성은 Unity가 자동으로 갱신하지 않아요."},"252":{"id":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting#패키지가-최신으로-안-바뀜","content":"Package Manager에서 해당 패키지 선택 → **Update** 버튼"},"253":{"id":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting#패키지가-최신으로-안-바뀜","content":"그래도 안 되면 `Library/PackageCache/com.achieve.achieve-package-manager@*` 폴더 삭제 후 Unity 재시작"},"254":{"id":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting#패키지가-최신으로-안-바뀜","content":"또는 manifest에서 한 번 제거 → 다시 추가"},"255":{"id":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting#openupm-목록이-안-뜨거나-비어-있음","content":"네트워크가 막혀 있는지 확인 (`https://package.openupm.com/-/all` 접근 가능 여부)"},"256":{"id":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/troubleshooting#openupm-목록이-안-